+---
+id: dl-003-centralize-task-input-validation
+type: decision-log
+title: "Centralize task input validation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Task data can enter through several public list operations. Validation must reject malformed values
+with clear errors and must never partially modify the list.
+
+## Decision
+
+Use shared validation helpers in the task-list domain before an operation changes state. They will
+return the existing domain `Result` error form with field-specific messages. `add`, `rename`, and
+`tag` will call the helpers before creating or updating a task.
+
+## Consequences
+
+All entry points apply the same rules and rejected input preserves the existing list. Future task
+input paths can reuse the helpers rather than reimplementing constraints.
